 "rules": [
  "Every text element maps to exactly one named style. No free font sizes.",
  "Emphasis uses the style's emphasizedWeight, never a different size.",
  "Use lineHeightTight only for single line labels inside controls; lineHeightLoose only for long reading text.",
  "Numbers that change (timers, prices, counters) use tabular figures: font-variant-numeric tabular-nums.",
  "Titles never use letter-spacing above trackingEm; never uppercase labels except iOS section footers are sentence case and macOS table headers are title case."
 ]
